NOTICE for the DBC code ports in sim/

This notice covers exactly two files. Both port code from
MeteoraAg/dynamic-bonding-curve (https://github.com/MeteoraAg/dynamic-bonding-curve):

- sim/dbc_curve.py: an integer port of that program's bonding-curve swap and
  fee math (curve.rs, state/virtual_pool.rs and state/config.rs).
- sim/curve_factory.py: its total_base_on_curve() repeats DBC's
  get_base_token_for_swap, which sums the base amount of each curve segment
  rounded up.

Required Notice: All underlying software code is subject to the licence set out at https://github.com/MeteoraAg/dynamic-bonding-curve

